        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Profession setup, five recipe-token cooldowns and soulbound materials.\n\n1. Choose a character with Tailoring. In Stormshield or Warspear visit the profession recipe vendor and obtain the Draenor profession training scroll and its starter recipes. The Garrison crafting-building NPC cannot craft this mount for a character without the profession.\n\n2. Make one Secret of Draenor Tailoring each day until you have five. Keep them on the crafter; spend the five on 111556 (Pattern: Creeping Carpet). Do not spend the recipe tokens on optional patterns before saving the mount's five.\n\n3. Produce 100 Hexweave Cloth using the profession cooldown and Tailoring Emporium work orders. These materials are soulbound; buying another player's finished cloth or leather is not a shortcut. Supply Sumptuous Fur to the work-order NPC and collect completed orders regularly.\n\n4. Buy or make 20 Sorcerous Air. Open the learned mount recipe and raise Draenor Tailoring if its displayed skill requirement is not yet met; pre-profession-split totals such as 700 are obsolete.\n\n5. Craft Creeping Carpet, then use it to learn Creeping Carpet. The finished item is not an Auction House purchase route. Retain the profession if the Mount Journal lists it as a riding requirement.",
