        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=116383",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 14,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Several setup-sensitive fights, three Darmac kill orders and a ten-player Kromog mechanic.\n\n1. Track Glory of the Draenor Raider. Bring a Toy Train Set and Wind-Up Train Wrecker, a player with reliable interrupts/displacement, and at least ten players for Kromog. Enter Highmaul in western Draenor Nagrand (33.0,38.0) on Normal or higher.\n\n2. At Kargath, kill him without letting Berserker Rush destroy any Fire Pillars. At the Butcher, stop damage and lead six spawned Maggots into his cleave so HE kills them; after six credited deaths, finish him.\n\n3. At Brackenspore, use a flamethrower to burn moss until one player reaches fifteen Burning Infusion stacks, then kill the boss. The expanded reply corrects the old personal-only warning: one player's completed stack condition awards the raid. At Tectus, split both shards before finishing their motes, gather all eight motes and kill the eight within ten seconds.\n\n4. Keep the Twin Ogron together so Disposition never exceeds 30%, then kill them. At Ko'ragh, a fast kill before fifteen unprotected Overflowing Energy impacts is the straightforward method; if waiting, use the barrier mechanic to soak correctly.\n\n5. At Imperator Mar'gok, preserve one Gorian Warmage through BOTH intermissions. Move it into the first boss mist to gain Fortification, position it at the next intermission spot before pushing the boss, and let it gain Replication there. Interrupt/step out at the end of casts to make it follow, or use Death Grip. Verify BOTH buffs, kill that warmage, then finish Mar'gok.\n\n6. Enter Blackrock Foundry (Gorgrond 51.5,27.5). At Gruul, use Overhead Smash's launch to reach and click the three Pristine True Iron Ores above the room; collect all three before killing him. Use safe landing/movement abilities rather than simply killing Gruul under the ore.\n\n7. At Oregorger, pick up the Volatile Ore and pass it between positioned players toward the Ore Grinder. The carrier cannot move and being rolled over loses the ore. Deposit it in the grinder before killing the boss. If the extra-action button disappears or the ore is lost, reset the attempt instead of finishing an invalid kill.\n\n8. At Beastlord Darmac, complete three eligible kills with a different final prime beast each time: Cruelfang, Ironcrusher and Dreadwing. Position him by the intended next beast so the riding order makes the required beast last. Use another eligible difficulty or weekly reset for the remaining last-beast criteria.\n\n9. At Flamebender, keep Aknor Steelbringer alive through Ka'graz's death; avoid cleave on him. At Hans'gar and Franzok, avoid every stamping press until both bosses die.\n\n10. At Thogar, place the Toy Train Set on a track that is about to receive a passing train. Summon the Wind-Up Train Wrecker to wreck the toy, then let the real train run over the wrecker. Confirm the criterion rather than killing Thogar before the train event.\n\n11. At Blast Furnace, expose all four Primal Elementalists using Slag Elemental deaths, lower their health carefully and coordinate their deaths within ten seconds. Finish the encounter after all four are credited.\n\n12. At Kromog, have ten players stand in separate Grasping Earth runes so ten hands actually seize players and become attackable. Kill those ten hands within five seconds, then kill Kromog. Pets or waiting through multiple hand waves do not replace ten players grabbed together.\n\n13. At Iron Maidens, lower all three bosses, then kill all three within ten seconds. At Blackhand, reach the last platform, stop damage and catch twenty Falling Ashes around the platform edge. Use movement/glide tools carefully and check the running criterion before killing Blackhand; old instructions to throw most of the raid off the platform are unnecessary.\n\n14. Check all seventeen criteria. Finish missing Darmac orders on later eligible clears, collect Gorestrider Gronnling from the achievement reward and learn it.",
    },
