        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Contested, infrequent spawns at several locations can require long camps.\n\n1. Travel to the Draenor zone shown in the map selector. Use a character able to survive the rare; a high-level character makes the fight straightforward. Leave bag space for the mount.\n\n2. Search north of the Ring of Blood and along the Skysong Lake / Mok'gol approaches. If group members can see Nakk but you cannot, finish the local Nagrand story phase; a 2026 report specifically found him after A Taste of Iron (35169). This is a troubleshooting report, not a proven mandatory unlock.\n\n3. When Nakk the Thunderer appears, make sure your own character receives an eligible tag before it dies. Coordinate with nearby collectors and use controlled damage so they can tag too; simply standing beside a group is insufficient.\n\n4. Defeat Nakk the Thunderer, loot the corpse and check your bags for Bloodhoof Bull. Learn the item. If you missed the tag or the rare was already dead, return to searching; repeatedly killing ordinary creatures does not force this rare to spawn.",
