        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Low random drop chance with one eligible Mythic clear per character per week.\n\n1. Set legacy raid difficulty to Mythic before entering Blackrock Foundry in northern Gorgrond (51.5,27.5). Use a high-level character and check that this character has not already killed Mythic Blackhand this week.\n\n2. On a full run, clear the three wings: Gruul/Oregorger/Blast Furnace, Hans'gar and Franzok/Flamebender/Kromog, and Beastlord/Thogar/Iron Maidens. Operate the Blast Furnace mechanics and Iron Maidens ship phase as required; killing one wing alone does not unlock Blackhand.\n\n3. Pick up Sigil of the Black Hand from Goraluk Anvilcrack inside the raid for future visits. Collect the Mythic quest's marked wing-boss components and turn it in. Modern Retail reports allow progress from eligible Warband alts, so follow the shared quest counter instead of assuming four personal weekly waits.\n\n4. Once the Mythic skip is unlocked, use its entrance-area dialogue to reach Blackhand faster on later eligible characters. Defeat Blackhand and loot the boss for Ironhoof Destroyer.\n\n5. Use the mount item if it drops. Otherwise return after the weekly reset or run another eligible character. Changing raid difficulty does not make a second Mythic Blackhand attempt on the same character.",
