        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A repeatable reputation grind, currency preparation and vendor purchase.\n\n1. Use a Alliance character for the purchase. Check Sha'tari Defense in the Reputation panel and check whether the counterpart already unlocked this mount on your account.\n\n2. Build a level 2 Trading Post to open the ordinary Sha'tari Defense kill-reputation route. Farm Sargerei around Shattrath City and Bladefury Hold in Talador. A level 3 Trading Post increases Draenor reputation gains, but level 2 is enough to open the faction.\n\n3. Continue until the reputation panel shows Exalted. If using reputation tokens, check the token's faction and current reputation gain before spending badges; Ashran's PvP factions are separate from these PvE reputations.\n\n4. Bring 5,000 Apexis Crystals and enough gold to Maaria. The quartermaster is at the Trading Post plot in your Garrison; the map pin is a Garrison reference because building placement varies. Buy the mount and learn it.",
