            { mapID = 85, x = 0.484, y = 0.7559999999999999, step = 3, label = "Goram - Horde guild vendor" },
        },
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-14",
        itemId = 116666,
        name = "Blacksteel Battleboar",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=116666",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Find an unlocked guild, earn guild Exalted and pay the vendor price.\n\n1. Find and join a guild that already has Guild Glory of the Draenor Raider completed. Confirm the achievement in its guild panel or ask before joining; the personal Glory of the Draenor Raider achievement does not substitute for the guild unlock.\n\n2. Earn Exalted reputation with that guild on the purchasing character, for example by completing reputation-awarding quests while a member. Track the guild reputation separately from Draenor factions.\n\n3. Visit a guild vendor such as Shay Pressler in Stormwind or Goram in Orgrimmar. At Exalted, locate Blacksteel Battleboar in the shop and buy it for the displayed gold price.\n\n4. Use the mount item. If it is missing from the shop, recheck your personal guild reputation and the GUILD achievement, then relog after a recent unlock. A brief historical 'item not found' bug was reported fixed; it is not evidence that the mount is retired.",
    },
