        name = "Armored Frostboar",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=116668",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Stables upgrades, six trained/captured beasts and thirty-six deliberate kill credits.\n\n1. Capture all six beasts using the level 1 Stables introductions. Upgrade the Stables to level 2. Pick up Black Claw of Sethe from inside the building and finish its short conversation quest if offered.\n\n2. Get all six mount-in-training whistles. If the daily chains are already finished, ask Keegan Firebeard (Alliance) or Tormak the Scarred (Horde) for replacement whistles; finishing a chain does not permanently lock you out of this achievement.\n\n3. Put Black Claw of Sethe in your character's bags and keep it there. It weakens/slows the training mount. Open Advanced Husbandry in the achievement panel and track its six target counters.\n\n4. Visit Gorian Beast-Lasher (79.2,71.6), Thundercall (90.6,23.6), Ironbore (53.2,77.6), Karak the Great Hunter (69.0,34.3), Maimclaw (63.0,80.0), and Moth of Wrath (43.0,69.1), all in Draenor Nagrand. At EACH target use a different whistle and kill it once on every training beast: talbuk, clefthoof, boar, riverbeast, elekk and wolf. Wait for respawns between kills.\n\n5. That is 36 separate credits. Remain on the training vehicle for every kill; normal mounts do not count. If one counter is short, repeat that target with the missing beast rather than restarting the whole route.\n\n6. When the achievement completes, check the Mount Journal for Armored Frostboar. The reward is automatic. You can bank the modifier after all required credits are recorded.",
    },
    [171632] = {
        category = "Achievements",
        source = "Glory of the Draenor Hero",
        sourceAchievementId = 9396,
        description = "Clear the eight Draenor Heroic dungeons and complete the eighteen specific challenges required by the meta.",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Several careful add/vehicle setups, knockbacks and a timed escort; plan multiple visits if a boss is killed too soon.",
        requirements = "Heroic dungeon difficulty; useful knockback and resurrection tools",
        commentIds = { 2062753, 2003120 },
        tips = "Walk into Heroic versions, including the Warlords version of Upper Blackrock Spire. Proving Grounds is not needed to walk in. Skyreach's extra challenges, Demon's Souls, No Tag-backs! and They Burn, Burn, Burn are not criteria of this mount meta.",
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 525, x = 0.496, y = 0.247, step = 2, label = "Bloodmaul Slag Mines entrance" },
            { mapID = 543, x = 0.45399999999999996, y = 0.135, step = 3, label = "Iron Docks entrance" },
            { mapID = 535, x = 0.44799999999999995, y = 0.745, step = 4, label = "Auchindoun entrance" },
            { mapID = 543, x = 0.552, y = 0.316, step = 5, label = "Grimrail Depot entrance" },
            { mapID = 543, x = 0.595, y = 0.455, step = 6, label = "The Everbloom entrance" },
            { mapID = 539, x = 0.319, y = 0.42700000000000005, step = 7, label = "Shadowmoon Burial Grounds entrance" },
            { mapID = 542, x = 0.35600000000000004, y = 0.33899999999999997, step = 8, label = "Skyreach entrance" },
            {
                mapID = 36,
                x = 0.20800000000000002,
                y = 0.374,
                step = 9,
                label = "Enter Blackrock Mountain; climb to the Upper Blackrock Spire balcony",
            },
        },
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-14",
        itemId = 116670,
        name = "Frostplains Battleboar",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=116670",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 10,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Several careful add/vehicle setups, knockbacks and a timed escort; plan multiple visits if a boss is killed too soon.\n\n1. Track Glory of the Draenor Hero and set dungeon difficulty to Heroic. Clear all eight dungeons for Draenor Dungeon Hero. Disable damage procs/pets before setup fights and bring a knockback-capable helper for Grimrail if your class lacks a suitable ability.\n\n2. Bloodmaul Slag Mines: kill Slave Watcher Crushto first, rescue Croman and keep his escort player alive through the remaining dungeon. At Gog'duh, stop damage until Calamity and Ruination are summoned; kill Magmolatus while BOTH adds remain alive. At Gug'rokk, use single-target damage and never kill an Unstable Slag before the boss dies.\n\n3. Iron Docks: preserve Siegemaster Olugar, Pitwarden Gwarnok and Champion Druna, pull all three INTO combat with Nok'gar, then kill Nok'gar while they remain alive. Afterward, wait until four out-of-combat Ogron Laborers line up and launch one Iron Star through all four. At Skulloc avoid Cannon Barrage and Backdraft, using the crates for cover if the fight reaches those casts.\n\n4. Auchindoun: at Soulbinder Nyami, wait for Torn Spirits to produce at least twelve fallen Auchenai protectors. Keep them alive with controlled damage and kiting, gather them, kill twelve within three seconds, then defeat Nyami. Clear the other bosses for Heroic completion.\n\n5. Grimrail Depot: aim Borka's Mad Dash through all four pieces of Priceless Paraphernalia before killing the first encounter. At Nitrogg, preserve incoming enemies and knock twenty off the train with suitable displacement abilities; ordinary damage kills do not count as abrupt removal. Check No Ticket's progress before finishing him.\n\n6. The Everbloom: defeat Witherbark before any water globule replenishes Aqueous Energy; burst during the dry phase and intercept water if necessary. At Yalnu, keep the allied mages alive, killing Entanglement vines promptly so no mage dies.\n\n7. Shadowmoon Burial Grounds: for Sadana, step on unneeded lunar runes so only the runes matching her active lunar cycle remain lit when she dies. Preserve at least twenty-five Corpse Skitterlings between Nhallish and Bonemaw, lead them into Bonemaw's Inhale, confirm twenty-five are swallowed, then kill Bonemaw. At Ner'zhul kill two Ritual of Bones skeletons within five seconds, then finish the boss.\n\n8. Skyreach: clear all four bosses on Heroic for Draenor Dungeon Hero. The four optional Skyreach challenge achievements are not needed for this mount; check the meta instead of an old guide's complete dungeon-achievement list.\n\n9. Upper Blackrock Spire: kill Orebender before he casts Thundering Cacophony four times, operating conduits when needed. After Kyrak, resurrect Leeroy, then clear the route and Son of the Beast before his fifteen-minute chicken timer finishes; stay until he reaches and loots his shoulders. At Ragewing, hold both ten-whelp waves alive and kill twenty within ten seconds. At Zaela, preserve the encounter until you have killed five Emberscale Ironflight, then finish her.\n\n10. Check all required challenge criteria and all eight Heroic completions. If an encounter was killed before its setup, return on the next eligible Heroic reset. Collect and learn Frostplains Battleboar when the meta completes.",
    },
