        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A repeatable artifact and reputation farm followed by a guaranteed purchase.\n\n1. Go to the Steamwheedle camp at the Ruins of Na'gwa in Draenor Nagrand (50.2,41.2). Speak to the artifact collectors there; this is the Preservation Society, not the older Steamwheedle Cartel city reputations.\n\n2. Kill creatures in northern Nagrand and loot Gorian Artifact Fragments. Sweep the ogre ruins for Highmaul Reliquaries. Kill named large beasts when encountered and keep their named trophy items; those provide separate reputation hand-ins.\n\n3. Return to the camp and hand in fragment bundles, reliquaries and beast trophies. Repeat the loop until Exalted. Medallions of the Legion and the appropriate Warlords Timewalking commendation can shorten the grind.\n\n4. Buy Domesticated Razorback from camp quartermaster Kwilax Fuseshiv, or from Gazrix Gearlock in Stormshield / Mimi Wizzlebub in Warspear, with 5,000 Apexis Crystals and the displayed gold cost. Learn the mount item.",
