        mountCategory = "Rare Drops",
        sourceType = "Rare Drops",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Contested, infrequent spawns at several locations can require long camps.\n\n1. Travel to the Draenor zone shown in the map selector. Use a character able to survive the rare; a high-level character makes the fight straightforward. Leave bag space for the mount.\n\n2. Check all five Frostfire Ridge spawn areas. Gorok is the rare boar, not a similarly named humanoid; the southern and northern locations are far enough apart that camping one point misses the others.\n\n3. When Gorok appears, make sure your own character receives an eligible tag before it dies. Coordinate with nearby collectors and use controlled damage so they can tag too; simply standing beside a group is insufficient.\n\n4. Defeat Gorok, loot the corpse and check your bags for Great Greytusk. Learn the item. If you missed the tag or the rare was already dead, return to searching; repeatedly killing ordinary creatures does not force this rare to spawn.",
