        reviewedAt = "2026-11-14",
        itemId = 116767,
        name = "Sapphire Riverbeast",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=116767",
        mountCategory = "Rare Drops",
        sourceType = "Rare Drops",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Contested, infrequent spawns at several locations can require long camps.\n\n1. Travel to the Draenor zone shown in the map selector. Use a character able to survive the rare; a high-level character makes the fight straightforward. Leave bag space for the mount.\n\n2. Search Talador's riverbanks and pools, including the pool south of Auchindoun. Silthide is a larger blue-grey riverbeast with a neutral nameplate; ordinary riverbeasts do not award the mount.\n\n3. When Silthide appears, make sure your own character receives an eligible tag before it dies. Coordinate with nearby collectors and use controlled damage so they can tag too; simply standing beside a group is insufficient.\n\n4. Defeat Silthide, loot the corpse and check your bags for Sapphire Riverbeast. Learn the item. If you missed the tag or the rare was already dead, return to searching; repeatedly killing ordinary creatures does not force this rare to spawn.",
    },
