        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Story reputation plus a repeatable kill/token grind.\n\n1. Complete the Arakkoa Outcasts story quests in Talador and Spires of Arak for the initial reputation. Check the faction panel before farming so you know the remaining amount.\n\n2. Farm hostile enemies at Lost Veil Anzu in eastern Spires of Arak (73.0,45.0). Loot the kills and keep cycling through the ruins. Relic of Rukhmar (117492) mission tokens, Medallions of the Legion and Warlords Timewalking commendations are alternative reputation sources.\n\n3. At Exalted, bring 5,000 Apexis Crystals and the displayed gold cost to Shadow-Sage Brakoss in Stormshield or Ravenspeaker Skeega in Warspear. The usual Exalted discount reduces the 5,000 gold base price to 4,000.\n\n4. Buy Shadowmane Charger, use the item and check the Mount Journal. The mount is not a drop from the ordinary talbuks you pass while farming.",
