        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - PvP participation, corpse-loot reputation tokens, queues and 100 Marks of Honor.\n\n1. Use a Alliance character and queue for Ashran through Specific Epic Battlegrounds, or the Classic Ashran brawl when the in-game calendar offers it. The ordinary outdoor Ashran map is not the battleground reputation farm.\n\n2. Stay near the active battle and loot defeated enemy PLAYERS with Remove Insignia before their corpses disappear. Keep the blue racial trophy/body-part items. These are the valuable reputation hand-ins; Artifact Fragments from ordinary NPCs are a much slower supplement.\n\n3. Before the battleground ends, return to your faction base and use the trophy item's quest/hand-in instructions to find its collector. Hand in the racial trophies and verify the correct Ashran faction reputation increases. Tokens disappear when you leave, so do not save them for the next match.\n\n4. Repeat until Wrynn's Vanguard is Exalted. The brawl can give more time to collect tokens than a fast ordinary battleground; use it when available. Treat old boss/event reputation figures as mode-dependent rather than guaranteed ordinary Ashran rewards.\n\n5. Earn and save 100 Marks of Honor from PvP reward sources, including the Comp Stomp brawl when scheduled. Visit Crafticus Mindbender in Stormshield, outside the battleground, and pay the current gold price plus marks. Learn Pale Thorngrazer from bags.",
    },
