        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Contested, infrequent spawns at several locations can require long camps.\n\n1. Travel to the Draenor zone shown in the map selector. Use a character able to survive the rare; a high-level character makes the fight straightforward. Leave bag space for the mount.\n\n2. Cover the northern Iron Docks approach and central Gorgrond spawn areas. Recent Midnight reports contradict the old claim that a shard must be up for at least 48 hours; do not schedule the hunt around that claim.\n\n3. When Poundfist appears, make sure your own character receives an eligible tag before it dies. Coordinate with nearby collectors and use controlled damage so they can tag too; simply standing beside a group is insufficient.\n\n4. Defeat Poundfist, loot the corpse and check your bags for Sunhide Gronnling. Learn the item. If you missed the tag or the rare was already dead, return to searching; repeatedly killing ordinary creatures does not force this rare to spawn.",
    },
    [171851] = {
        category = "Rare Drops",
        npcId = 81001,
        source = "Nok-Karosh, Frostfire Ridge; also tradable on the Auction House",
        description = "A tradable wolf from Nok-Karosh. An Auction House purchase avoids the spawn wait.",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "An easy legacy elite or a direct purchase; the main delay is waiting for a spawn.",
        commentIds = { 2005212, 3169278, 3242760 },
        tips = "Old launch-era raid kiting and Master Looter instructions are obsolete. Group loot reports disagree across patches; soloing avoids uncertainty about whose tag awards loot.",
        waypoints = { { mapID = 525, x = 0.13, y = 0.508, step = 2, label = "Nok-Karosh - Garn Nighthowl" } },
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-14",
        itemId = 116794,
        name = "Garn Nighthowl",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=116794",
        mountCategory = "Rare Drops",
        sourceType = "Rare Drops",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - An easy legacy elite or a direct purchase; the main delay is waiting for a spawn.\n\n1. Search the Auction House for Garn Nighthowl and compare its current price with the time you want to spend camping. The mount item can be traded before use.\n\n2. To farm it yourself, travel to Nok-Karosh at 13.0,50.8 in western Frostfire Ridge, north of Wor'gol. Identify the named elite among the ordinary Garn Nighthowl wolves.\n\n3. Kill Nok-Karosh and loot the mount. A high-level character can handle the surrounding wolves; the old requirement for a large kiting raid no longer applies. If grouped, use a small party and make sure you personally tag.\n\n4. Learn Garn Nighthowl from your bags. Additional kills can award additional tradable copies; this farm does not use Rukhmar's weekly world-boss mount lockout. Respawn reports vary, so allow for a wait.",
    },
}

